'x_mo-definition'(x_inRegion,"&quot;C located_in C' if and only if: given any c that instantiates C at a time t, there is some c' such that: c' instantiates C' at time t and c *located_in* c'. (Here *located_in* is the instance-level location relation.)&quot; [PMID:15892874]") :- x_cid(a65b125bc8c581).
