'x_mo-definition'('x_OBO_REL-transformation_of',"&quot;Relation between two classes, in which instances retain their identity yet change their classification by virtue of some kind of transformation. Formally: C transformation_of C' if and only if given any c and any t, if c instantiates C at time t, then for some t', c instantiates C' at t' and t' earlier t, and there is no t2 such that c instantiates C at t2 and c instantiates C' at t2.&quot; [PMID:15892874]") :- x_cid(a65b125bc8c59b).
